<view class="page {{role}} "><include src="../../templates/load-status.wxml"/><view wx:if="{{denied}}" class="denied">{{denied}}<button class="primary" bindtap="home">返回首页</button></view><block wx:else><view style="padding:50rpx 0 40rpx"><view class="logo"><text class="logo-mark">丰</text><text>丰嘉盈</text></view></view><view class="heading-title">欢迎，幸运体验官</view><view class="subtitle">登录后收藏每一份好礼，连接身边好生意。</view><view class="card" style="margin-top:45rpx"><view class="field"><text class="field-label">手机号</text><input type="number" maxlength="11" placeholder="请输入手机号" value="{{phone}}" bindinput="phoneInput"/></view><view class="field"><text class="field-label">短信验证码</text><view class="sms-row"><input type="number" maxlength="6" placeholder="请输入后端控制台验证码" value="{{smsCode}}" bindinput="smsInput"/><button class="sms-button" bindtap="sendSms" disabled="{{countdown>0}}">{{countdown?countdown+'秒后重试':'获取验证码'}}</button></view></view><checkbox-group bindchange="agree"><label class="agreement"><checkbox value="agree" checked="{{agreed}}" color="#bf5b50"/>我已了解当前为开发联调环境，业务信息保存在服务端。</label></checkbox-group><button class="primary" bindtap="login" loading="{{busy}}" disabled="{{busy}}">登录 / 注册</button><button class="secondary" bindtap="quickLogin" disabled="{{busy}}">微信手机号快捷登录（模拟）</button></view><view class="note">短信验证码由后端生成并输出到开发控制台；领奖前需完成模拟微信绑定。</view></block></view>